#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:70
#: 465e00607e53492589ccc7e0608fc9b6
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:72
#: f88678ab6a3a4298a74e2302700eac7b
msgid "RC input is configured on the R3 (UART3_RX) pin. It supports all RC protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` is set to \"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:74
#: 03801dbfbda2428bb6988f17efd74320
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R6 pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:76
#: 584dd7b2c1624c42bb2fbef9f144255c
msgid "SBUS FPort requires connection to T3 and an external bi-directional inverter, see :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:78
#: be1232a0d0c14cd28a8c28da89b5ec4f
msgid "CRSF also requires a T3 connection, in addition to R6, and automatically provides telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:80
#: b13ffde6392d4c59b89875a0afb8aba1
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to R3 and T3 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL3_OPTIONS<SERIAL3_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:82
#: ff51adecad01445a93c38c7fb8257baf
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:85
#: 58559fb99d3149b4bbcccf28060ef5c7
msgid "ESC Telemetry"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:87
#: a8f7804fc839446a9861b969948b960f
msgid "The SERIAL5 port (UART5) is for ESC telemetry. It is connected through the motor connector and works out of the box with the `Tekko32 F3 Mini <https://shop.holybro.com/tekko32-f3-4in1-45a-mini-esc_p1132.html>`__ which is commonly paired with this autopilot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:90
#: 90fcb0bc8ed7497fbe61ef8ea45d4290
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:92
#: e23528cfb88047c6bc3a7a2ad23b5e91
msgid "FrSky Telemetry is supported using the SmartPort pad (UART1). You need to set the following parameters to enable support for FrSky S.PORT. It has built-in inverters and a diode to allow for operation from a single pin with no special adapters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:97
#: dd143a2ee9b145a4aa2d71975b6e203a
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 4 or 10"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef4-mini.rst:98
#: 4ac91af8035c445f83cb557388590994
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 0"
msgstr ""

